      "designInstructions": "# Apple Minimalist Design System\n\n## Layout & Composition\n- **Generous Whitespace**: Every element should have plenty of room to breathe. Use large vertical margins (py-24, py-32).\n- **Asymmetric Balance**: Combine large imagery with centered or left-aligned typography to create a premium feel.\n- **Content Hierarchy**: Clear distinction between massive headlines and clean, readable body text.\n\n## Typography\n- **Inter (SF Pro substitute)**: Use weights 400 (Body), 500 (Labels/Buttons), and 700 (Headlines).\n- **Size Contrast**: Headlines should be significantly larger (text-5xl or 6xl) compared to body text (text-lg).\n\n## Components\n- **Buttons**: Pill-shaped (`rounded-full`) with smooth transitions. Primary button uses Apple Blue (#0071e3).\n- **Cards**: Minimalist cards with very subtle borders (`border-gray-100`) or light gray backgrounds (`bg-[#f5f5f7]`). Avoid heavy shadows.\n- **Glassmorphism**: Use `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds for navigation bars and overlays.\n\n## Visual Language\n- **High-Quality Imagery**: Focus on crisp, professional photography of local business environments (clean kitchens, modern clinics).\n- **Iconography**: Use Lucide icons with thin strokes (stroke-width: 1.5) to match the refined aesthetic.\n- **Transitions**: Subtle fade-ins and scale-ups for a premium interactive experience.",
      "created": "2026-05-14T17:10:21.196283+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-05-14T17:10:21.196283+00:00"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parchment Humanist",
      "theme": {
        "seedColor": "#C96442",
        "colorThemeName": "Parchment Humanist",
        "palette": {
          "primary": "#C96442",
          "secondary": "#141413",
          "tertiary": "#629987",
          "neutral": "#FAF9F5"
        },
        "fonts": {
          "headline": {
            "family": "Instrument Serif",
            "url": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
          },
